Chapter: BvtKeeperHome
  cites Uoaix chapter CompositeGameRules
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtNpcMove
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck

 Live 44142: two Britain keepers never planned home. A keeper with no goal yet (a boot) bound home goes by the entrance,
 as every other homeward keeper does, and a keeper's home is one its plan budget reaches from the entrance both ways.
 On BvtNpcMove's fixture at game hour 3. Answers a bit per check: 1 a keeper with goal -1 bound home sets via-home, 2 a
 tile 5 west of the entrance is reached both ways, 4 a tile off the walk map is not, 8 a keeper on the entrance's tile a floor above it has reached the entrance (trial 44188: keepers 12, 14, 15 stood at 1495,1618,20); -1 to -4 a fixture that failed.
  bkh-night : Integer = 10800
  bkh-pick : Integer -> Integer
  bkh-pick (i) = if i >= bb-shop-count then -1 else if bsh-goal i bkh-night == 0 then i else bkh-pick (i + 1)
  bkh-run : CompositeGame -> Integer
  bkh-run (owner) = when owner.staff
    is None -> -1
    is Just (s) -> when owner.town
      is None -> -2
      is Just (t) -> when owner.town-map
        is None -> -3
        is Just (map) -> let i = bkh-pick 0
          in if i < 0 then -4
          else let k = list-at s.keepers i
          in let away = tl-copy-spot k.home (BbSpot { x = t.entrance.x - 9, y = t.entrance.y, z = t.entrance.z })
          in let unset = __record-set k "goal" (0 - 1)
          in let woke = __record-set k "next-step" 0
          in let stepped = bsh-keeper s t map owner.town-doors bkh-night i
          in let routed = if k.goal == 0 & k.via-home == 1 then 1 else 0
          in let near = if bsh-reaches t map owner.town-doors (BbSpot { x = t.entrance.x - 5, y = t.entrance.y, z = t.entrance.z }) then 2 else 0
          in let off = if bsh-reaches t map owner.town-doors (BbSpot { x = 1300, y = t.entrance.y, z = t.entrance.z }) then 0 else 4
          in let upstairs = when world-get t.vendors.game.world (list-at t.vendors.vendors i).serial
            is Err (_) -> 0
            is Ok (npc) -> let moved = world-update t.vendors.game.world (__record-set (__record-set (__record-set npc "x" t.entrance.x) "y" t.entrance.y) "z" (t.entrance.z + 20))
              in let via = __record-set k "via-home" 1
              in let again = __record-set k "next-step" 0
              in let stepped2 = bsh-keeper s t map owner.town-doors bkh-night i
              in if k.via-home == 0 then 8 else 0
          in routed + near + off + upstairs
  bvt-keeper-home : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-keeper-home (unused) = when bnm-founded 0
    is Err (e) -> bvt-check ("keeper home fixture: " & e) False
    is Ok (owner) -> act
      n <- bkh-run owner
      a <- bvt-check ("a keeper bound home at boot walks by the entrance, and a keeper's home is reached within its plan budget (code " & show n & ")") (n == 15)
      a
    end
